    "text": "11 hours ago Dr. Annamaria Andrei, 57, Jefferson City, passed away Friday Nov. 14, 2025. She was born Dec. 2, 1967, a daughter to Miklos Weissmuller and the late Erzsebet (Crovato) Weissmuller in Oradea, Romania. Her father survives in Hungary. She earned her PhD from Banat University of Agriculture Science and Veterinary Medicine... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
